    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every keyboard positioned on the left side of the image, there is a specific arrangement of surrounding objects. A mouse is located to the right of the keyboard, and they are aligned horizontally. Directly above the keyboard are headphones, while a lighter is placed to the left of the headphones. The keyboard is visually larger than the lighter. A ruler is situated below the keyboard. Beneath the ruler, a knife, a fork, and a spoon are arranged in a row from left to right and aligned horizontally. Additionally, a donut is placed above the mouse, and a bottle is positioned to the right of the mouse.",
